WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.508 --> 00:00:02.280
Guru Vandan Vidhi

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:05.600
When Guru Bhagwant is Sitting on their Asan

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.429
Guru Vandan should be performed only at that time

00:00:07.429 --> 00:00:09.746
First, Give 2 Khamasaman,

00:00:09.746 --> 00:00:14.654
Icchami KhamaSamano Vandiun, 
 Javanijjae Nisihiae, Mathaean Vandami

00:00:14.898 --> 00:00:19.708
Icchami KhamaSamano Vandiun, 
 Javanijjae Nisihiae, Mathaean Vandami

00:00:19.708 --> 00:00:21.458
after 2 Khamasaman

00:00:21.458 --> 00:00:24.153
Stand up with folded hands and say

00:00:24.153 --> 00:00:27.150
Icchakara Suha - Rai ? or Suha Devasi ?

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:29.327
Sukha - Tapa - Sharira - Nirabadha ?

00:00:29.327 --> 00:00:31.873
Sukha - Sanjama - Jatra - Nirvaho Cho ji ?

00:00:31.873 --> 00:00:33.685
Swami ! Shata Che ji ?

00:00:33.685 --> 00:00:35.803
Bhaat - Panino Labh Dejo ji

00:00:35.803 --> 00:00:38.364
If Sadhu Bhgawant has been Respected by a Padvi

00:00:38.364 --> 00:00:40.717
Then Give 1 more Khamasaman again,

00:00:40.717 --> 00:00:45.701
Icchami KhamaSamano Vandiun, 
 Javanijjae Nisihiae, Mathaean Vandami

00:00:45.844 --> 00:00:47.600
Then stand up and say

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.990
Ichhakarena Sandisaha Bhagwan

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:53.551
Abbhutthiomi, Abbhintara - Raiam or Devasiam Khameum ?

00:00:53.551 --> 00:00:56.332
Iccham, Khamemi Raiam or Devasiam

00:00:56.498 --> 00:00:59.513
Then touch your Kness to the ground,

00:00:59.513 --> 00:01:02.776
put the right hand first on the ground,

00:01:02.776 --> 00:01:05.535
and put left hand near mouth,

00:01:05.535 --> 00:01:07.929
bow your head down and say this Sutra

00:01:07.929 --> 00:01:12.280
Jan Kinchi Apattiyam, Parapattiyam, 
Bhatte Pane, Vinae, Veyavachche

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:16.939
 Alave, Samlave, Uchchasane, 
 Samasane, Antarabhasae, Uvribhasae,

00:01:16.939 --> 00:01:21.234
 Jan kinchi Majjha Vinaya - Parihinam, 
Suhumam Va, Bayarma Va

00:01:21.234 --> 00:01:24.967
Tubbhe Janaha, Aham Na Janami; 
 Tassa Michchhami Dukkadam

00:01:24.967 --> 00:01:27.102
Then Give 1 Khamasaman

00:01:27.102 --> 00:01:32.109
Icchami KhamaSamano Vandiun, 
 Javanijjae Nisihiae, Mathaean Vandami

00:01:32.109 --> 00:01:34.108
Take Yathashakti Pachchkhan 

00:01:34.108 --> 00:01:37.669
Icchakari Bhagwan Pasay Kari Pachchkhan Dejoji

00:01:37.669 --> 00:01:39.669
Then Give 1 Khamasaman

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:44.924
Icchami KhamaSamano Vandiun, 
 Javanijjae Nisihiae, Mathaean Vandami

00:01:44.924 --> 00:01:46.530
DharmaLabh

